{"id":54253,"date":"2024-12-10T17:06:33","title":{"rendered":"M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec3m s\u00e1ng t\u00ecnh h\u00ecnh kinh t\u1ebf &#8211; x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i th\u00e1ng M\u01b0\u1eddi M\u1ed9t v\u00e0 11 th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><div class=\"fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-1 nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling\" style=\"--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;\" ><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-row\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-0 fusion_builder_column_1_1 1_1 fusion-one-full fusion-column-first fusion-column-last\" style=\"--awb-bg-size:cover;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-column-wrapper-legacy\"><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-1\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trong th\u00e1ng 11, t\u00ecnh h\u00ecnh th\u1ebf gi\u1edbi ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c di\u1ec5n bi\u1ebfn ph\u1ee9c t\u1ea1p, kh\u00f3 l\u01b0\u1eddng, nhi\u1ec1u y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 b\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ecbnh; c\u1ea1nh tranh chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c gay g\u1eaft, xung \u0111\u1ed9t qu\u00e2n s\u1ef1, b\u1ea5t \u1ed5n ch\u00ednh tr\u1ecb gia t\u0103ng; t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u ph\u1ee5c h\u1ed3i ch\u1eadm; c\u00e1c th\u00e1ch th\u1ee9c an ninh phi truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng t\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed9ng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp, \u0111a chi\u1ec1u \u0111\u1ebfn ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u1ee7a nhi\u1ec1u qu\u1ed1c gia, khu v\u1ef1c. \u1ede trong n\u01b0\u1edbc, ch\u00ednh tr\u1ecb, x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh, \u0111\u1eddi s\u1ed1ng v\u1eadt ch\u1ea5t v\u00e0 tinh th\u1ea7n c\u1ee7a Nh\u00e2n d\u00e2n ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u00e2ng l\u00ean. Tuy nhi\u00ean, n\u01b0\u1edbc ta ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c \u0111\u1ed1i di\u1ec7n v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u kh\u00f3 kh\u0103n b\u1edfi t\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed9ng b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 nh\u1eefng h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf, b\u1ea5t c\u1eadp n\u1ed9i t\u1ea1i k\u00e9o d\u00e0i, thi\u00ean tai, b\u00e3o, l\u1ee5t ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c g\u00e2y thi\u1ec7t h\u1ea1i t\u1ea1i nhi\u1ec1u \u0111\u1ecba ph\u01b0\u01a1ng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Tr\u01b0\u1edbc b\u1ed1i c\u1ea3nh \u0111\u00f3, d\u01b0\u1edbi s\u1ef1 l\u00e3nh \u0111\u1ea1o, ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ea1o t\u1eadp trung, th\u1ed1ng nh\u1ea5t, s\u00e1ng su\u1ed1t, khoa h\u1ecdc c\u1ee7a Ban Ch\u1ea5p h\u00e0nh Trung \u01b0\u01a1ng \u0110\u1ea3ng m\u00e0 tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp, th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean l\u00e0 B\u1ed9 Ch\u00ednh tr\u1ecb, Ban B\u00ed th\u01b0, \u0111\u1ee9ng \u0111\u1ea7u l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed3ng ch\u00ed T\u1ed5ng B\u00ed th\u01b0 T\u00f4 L\u00e2m; s\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed3ng h\u00e0nh, ph\u1ed1i h\u1ee3p ch\u1eb7t ch\u1ebd c\u1ee7a Qu\u1ed1c h\u1ed9i v\u00e0 c\u00e1c c\u01a1 quan trong h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng ch\u00ednh tr\u1ecb; s\u1ef1 n\u1ed7 l\u1ef1c, \u0111\u1ed3ng l\u00f2ng c\u1ee7a Nh\u00e2n d\u00e2n, c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng doanh nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 \u1ee7ng h\u1ed9 c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf; Ch\u00ednh ph\u1ee7, Th\u1ee7 t\u01b0\u1edbng Ch\u00ednh ph\u1ee7, c\u00e1c c\u1ea5p, c\u00e1c ng\u00e0nh, c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecba ph\u01b0\u01a1ng lu\u00f4n n\u1eafm ch\u1eafc th\u1ef1c ti\u1ec5n, \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u00e0nh ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng, linh ho\u1ea1t, k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi qu\u00e1n tri\u1ec7t v\u00e0 tri\u1ec3n khai quy\u1ebft li\u1ec7t, \u0111\u1ed3ng b\u1ed9, hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, c\u00f3 tr\u1ecdng t\u00e2m, tr\u1ecdng \u0111i\u1ec3m c\u00e1c nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ee5, gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p tr\u00ean c\u00e1c l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c. Nh\u1edd \u0111\u00f3, kinh t\u1ebf &#8211; x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i th\u00e1ng 11 v\u00e0 11 th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c kh\u1eb3ng \u0111\u1ecbnh s\u1ef1 ph\u1ee5c h\u1ed3i r\u00f5 n\u00e9t, th\u00e1ng sau t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n th\u00e1ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc, t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng qu\u00fd sau cao h\u01a1n qu\u00fd tr\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0 t\u1ed1t h\u01a1n c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 tr\u00ean h\u1ea7u h\u1ebft c\u00e1c l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c; d\u1ef1 ki\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ea1t v\u00e0 v\u01b0\u1ee3t 15\/15 ch\u1ec9 ti\u00eau ch\u1ee7 y\u1ebfu ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n kinh t\u1ebf &#8211; x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i c\u1ee7a c\u1ea3 n\u0103m 2024. M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 n\u00e9t ch\u00ednh v\u1ec1 kinh t\u1ebf &#8211; x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i th\u00e1ng M\u01b0\u1eddi M\u1ed9t v\u00e0 m\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 c\u1ee7a n\u01b0\u1edbc ta nh\u01b0 sau:<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(1) Thu ho\u1ea1ch l\u00faa thu \u0111\u00f4ng v\u00e0 m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 c\u00e2y rau m\u00e0u v\u1ee5 \u0111\u00f4ng t\u0103ng so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; ch\u0103n nu\u00f4i l\u1ee3n v\u00e0 gia c\u1ea7m nh\u00ecn chung \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh; s\u1ea3n l\u01b0\u1ee3ng khai th\u00e1c g\u1ed7 t\u0103ng kh\u00e1; gi\u00e1 c\u00e1 tra v\u00e0 t\u00f4m n\u01b0\u1edbc l\u1ee3 t\u0103ng \u0111\u00e3 khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch ng\u01b0\u1eddi nu\u00f4i thu ho\u1ea1ch, \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng nhu c\u1ea7u ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng trong n\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0 ch\u1ebf bi\u1ebfn xu\u1ea5t kh\u1ea9u<\/em><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u00ednh \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u00e0y 20\/11\/2024, di\u1ec7n t\u00edch thu ho\u1ea1ch l\u00faa thu \u0111\u00f4ng t\u1ea1i v\u00f9ng \u0110\u1ed3ng b\u1eb1ng s\u00f4ng C\u1eedu Long \u0111\u1ea1t 414,3 ngh\u00ecn ha, t\u0103ng 3,2% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; s\u1ea3n l\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea1t 4,2 tri\u1ec7u t\u1ea5n, t\u0103ng 118,5 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ea5n; n\u0103ng su\u1ea5t \u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea1t 57,9 t\u1ea1\/ha, t\u0103ng t\u0103ng 0,8 t\u1ea1\/ha. Di\u1ec7n t\u00edch gieo tr\u1ed3ng m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 c\u00e2y rau m\u00e0u v\u1ee5 \u0111\u00f4ng t\u0103ng kh\u00e1: Ng\u00f4 \u0111\u1ea1t 83,2 ngh\u00ecn ha, t\u0103ng 7,5%; l\u1ea1c \u0111\u1ea1t 4,7 ngh\u00ecn ha, t\u0103ng 5,3%; rau, \u0111\u1eadu c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ea1t 146,20 ngh\u00ecn ha, t\u0103ng 4,7%; khoai lang \u0111\u1ea1t 15 ngh\u00ecn ha, t\u0103ng 2,5%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 1. Di\u1ec7n t\u00edch gieo tr\u1ed3ng m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 c\u00e2y h\u00e0ng n\u0103m <\/strong><em>(T\u00ednh \u0111\u1ebfn 20\/11\/2024)<\/em><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload size-full wp-image-54254 aligncenter\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27619%27%20height%3D%27244%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20619%20244%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27619%27%20height%3D%27244%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"619\" height=\"244\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u00e0n l\u1ee3n v\u00e0 gia c\u1ea7m ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh, ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 nhu c\u1ea7u ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng t\u0103ng cao d\u1ecbp L\u1ec5, T\u1ebft cu\u1ed1i n\u0103m. T\u1ed5ng \u0111\u00e0n l\u1ee3n t\u1ea1i th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m cu\u1ed1i th\u00e1ng 11\/2024 t\u0103ng 3,5% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; \u0111\u00e0n gia c\u1ea7m t\u0103ng 2,9%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">S\u1ea3n l\u01b0\u1ee3ng g\u1ed7 khai th\u00e1c th\u00e1ng M\u01b0\u1eddi M\u1ed9t \u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea1t 2.366,2 ngh\u00ecn m<sup>3<\/sup>, t\u0103ng 7,5% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc do nhu c\u1ea7u g\u1ed7 nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 m\u00e1y ch\u1ebf bi\u1ebfn t\u0103ng cao, gi\u00e1 g\u1ed7 \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh \u0111\u00e3 khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00e2n t\u00edch c\u1ef1c khai th\u00e1c; t\u00ednh chung m\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 \u0111\u1ea1t g\u1ea7n 20,9 tri\u1ec7u m<sup>3<\/sup>, t\u0103ng 7,9%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Gi\u00e1 c\u00e1 tra v\u00e0 gi\u00e1 t\u00f4m th\u1ebb nguy\u00ean li\u1ec7u t\u1ea1i v\u00f9ng \u0110\u1ed3ng b\u1eb1ng s\u00f4ng C\u1eedu Long t\u0103ng cao n\u00ean khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch ng\u01b0\u1eddi nu\u00f4i t\u0103ng c\u01b0\u1eddng thu ho\u1ea1ch. T\u00ednh chung m\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024, s\u1ea3n l\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u00e1 tra \u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea1t 1.625,8 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ea5n, t\u0103ng 4,7% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; t\u00f4m s\u00fa \u0111\u1ea1t 260,9 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ea5n, t\u0103ng 2,9%; t\u00f4m th\u1ebb ch\u00e2n tr\u1eafng \u0111\u1ea1t 894,9 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ea5n, t\u0103ng 6,1%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(2) <\/em><em>Ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t c\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p th\u00e1ng M\u01b0\u1eddi M\u1ed9t \u01b0\u1edbc t\u0103ng 8,9% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc, t\u00ednh chung m\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 t\u0103ng 8,4%.<\/em> Trong \u0111\u00f3, ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t ng\u00e0nh ch\u1ebf bi\u1ebfn, ch\u1ebf t\u1ea1o t\u0103ng 9,7% (c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc t\u0103ng 1%); ng\u00e0nh s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u0103ng 10,2%, \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng \u0111\u1ee7 nhu c\u1ea7u cho s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t kinh doanh v\u00e0 ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng c\u1ee7a d\u00e2n c\u01b0.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 2: T\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 t\u0103ng\/gi\u1ea3m ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t c\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p (%)<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload alignnone size-full wp-image-54255 aligncenter\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27517%27%20height%3D%27302%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20517%20302%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27517%27%20height%3D%27302%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"517\" height=\"302\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(3)<\/em> <em>Nhi\u1ec1u gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p ph\u1ee5c h\u1ed3i v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n du l\u1ecbch \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 \u00a0n\u00ean kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf \u0111\u1ebfn Vi\u1ec7t Nam t\u0103ng cao<\/em>. Kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf \u0111\u1ebfn n\u01b0\u1edbc ta th\u00e1ng 11\/2024 \u0111\u1ea1t 1,7 tri\u1ec7u l\u01b0\u1ee3t ng\u01b0\u1eddi, t\u0103ng 38,8% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; t\u00ednh chung m\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ea1t h\u01a1n 15,8 tri\u1ec7u l\u01b0\u1ee3t ng\u01b0\u1eddi, t\u0103ng 41%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 3: Kh\u00e1ch qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf \u0111\u1ebfn Vi\u1ec7t Nam 11 th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 ph\u00e2n theo v\u00f9ng l\u00e3nh th\u1ed5<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload aligncenter wp-image-54256\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27666%27%20height%3D%27334%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20666%20334%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27666%27%20height%3D%27334%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"666\" height=\"334\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(4) Nhu c\u1ea7u th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf \u0111ang tr\u00ean \u0111\u00e0 ph\u1ee5c h\u1ed3i, thu\u1eadn l\u1ee3i cho ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng xu\u1ea5t, nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a. <\/em>T\u1ed5ng kim ng\u1ea1ch xu\u1ea5t, nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a m\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 \u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea1t 715,55 t\u1ef7 USD, t\u0103ng 15,4% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc, trong \u0111\u00f3 xu\u1ea5t kh\u1ea9u t\u0103ng 14,4%; nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u t\u0103ng 16,4%. Trong m\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 c\u00f3 36 m\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ea1t kim ng\u1ea1ch xu\u1ea5t kh\u1ea9u tr\u00ean 1 t\u1ef7 USD, chi\u1ebfm 94,1% t\u1ed5ng kim ng\u1ea1ch xu\u1ea5t kh\u1ea9u (trong \u0111\u00f3 c\u00f3 7 m\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng xu\u1ea5t kh\u1ea9u \u0111\u1ea1t tr\u00ean 10 t\u1ef7 USD, chi\u1ebfm 66,5%).<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 4: Xu\u1ea5t, nh\u1eadp kh\u1ea9u h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a 11 th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload aligncenter wp-image-54257\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27700%27%20height%3D%27214%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20700%20214%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27700%27%20height%3D%27214%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"214\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00e1n c\u00e2n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a m\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 \u01b0\u1edbc t\u00ednh xu\u1ea5t si\u00eau 24,31 t\u1ef7 USD (c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc xu\u1ea5t si\u00eau 26,2 t\u1ef7 USD), g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u1ef7 gi\u00e1, t\u0103ng d\u1ef1 tr\u1eef ngo\u1ea1i h\u1ed1i c\u1ee7a n\u1ec1n kinh t\u1ebf.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(5) V\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh t\u0103ng th\u00eam trong m\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t th\u00e1ng n\u0103m nay l\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec3m s\u00e1ng t\u00edch c\u1ef1c c\u1ee7a n\u1ec1n kinh t\u1ebf, <\/em><em>cho th\u1ea5y c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c tin t\u01b0\u1edfng Vi\u1ec7t Nam l\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec3m \u0111\u1ebfn quan tr\u1ecdng v\u00e0 t\u0103ng c\u01b0\u1eddng m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng quy m\u00f4 c\u00e1c d\u1ef1 \u00e1n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0.<\/em><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u00ednh \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u00e0y 30\/11\/2024, c\u1ea3 n\u01b0\u1edbc c\u00f3 1.350 d\u1ef1 \u00e1n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec1u ch\u1ec9nh t\u0103ng v\u1ed1n v\u1edbi s\u1ed1 v\u1ed1n \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u0103ng th\u00eam \u0111\u1ea1t h\u01a1n 9,93 t\u1ef7 USD, t\u0103ng 12,9% v\u1ec1 s\u1ed1 d\u1ef1 \u00e1n v\u00e0 t\u0103ng 40,7% v\u1ec1 s\u1ed1 v\u1ed1n so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m 2023. V\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i Vi\u1ec7t Nam m\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 \u0111\u1ea1t 21,7 t\u1ef7 USD, t\u0103ng 7,1% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 5: V\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ea7u t\u01b0 n\u01b0\u1edbc ngo\u00e0i \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd v\u00e0o Vi\u1ec7t Nam 11 th\u00e1ng c\u00e1c n\u0103m 2020-2024 (T\u1ef7 USD)<\/strong><strong><sup> <a href=\"#_ftn1\" name=\"_ftnref1\">[1]<\/a><\/sup><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload size-full wp-image-54258 aligncenter\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27563%27%20height%3D%27260%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20563%20260%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27563%27%20height%3D%27260%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/5.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"563\" height=\"260\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(6) <\/em><em>L\u1ea1m ph\u00e1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t \u1edf m\u1ee9c ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p, h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 t\u00edch c\u1ef1c cho t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng kinh t\u1ebf. <\/em>Ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 gi\u00e1 ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng (CPI) th\u00e1ng m\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t n\u0103m 2024 so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc t\u0103ng 2,77%, th\u1ea5p h\u01a1n c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 c\u00e1c n\u0103m 2022 v\u00e0 2023 (4,37% v\u00e0 3,45%); b\u00ecnh qu\u00e2n m\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t th\u00e1ng CPI t\u0103ng 3,69%, \u01b0\u1edbc c\u1ea3 n\u0103m 2024 c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng \u0111\u1ea1t m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau Qu\u1ed1c h\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ec1 ra l\u00e0 4%-4,5%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 6: T\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 t\u0103ng ch\u1ec9 s\u1ed1 gi\u00e1 ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng th\u00e1ng 11 v\u00e0 11 th\u00e1ng so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc c\u00e1c n\u0103m 2020-2024 (%)<\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em> <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload alignnone size-full wp-image-54259\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27504%27%20height%3D%27323%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20504%20323%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27504%27%20height%3D%27323%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"504\" height=\"323\" \/><\/em><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(7) Thu ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch Nh\u00e0 n\u01b0\u1edbc t\u0103ng cao, ph\u1ea3n \u00e1nh s\u1ef1 ph\u1ee5c h\u1ed3i t\u00edch c\u1ef1c c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t, kinh doanh.<\/em> Thu ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch Nh\u00e0 n\u01b0\u1edbc m\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1ed9t th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024 \u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea1t 1.808,5 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ef7 \u0111\u1ed3ng, b\u1eb1ng 106,3% d\u1ef1 to\u00e1n n\u0103m v\u00e0 t\u0103ng 16,1% so v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng k\u1ef3 n\u0103m tr\u01b0\u1edbc; trong \u0111\u00f3 thu n\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ecba \u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea1t 1.506,5 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ef7 \u0111\u1ed3ng, b\u1eb1ng 104,3% v\u00e0 t\u0103ng 16,8%.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>H\u00ecnh 7: Thu, chi ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch Nh\u00e0 n\u01b0\u1edbc 11 th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2024<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload wp-image-54260 aligncenter\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27700%27%20height%3D%27214%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20700%20214%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27700%27%20height%3D%27214%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"214\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em>(8) <\/em><em>C\u00f4ng t\u00e1c b\u1ea3o \u0111\u1ea3m an sinh x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i lu\u00f4n \u0111\u01b0\u01a1\u0323c ca\u0301c c\u00e2\u0301p, nga\u0300nh th\u01b0\u0323c hi\u00ea\u0323n k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi, hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/em> Ch\u00ednh ph\u1ee7, c\u00e1c B\u1ed9, ng\u00e0nh, \u0111\u1ecba ph\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u00e3 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00e2n g\u1ea7n 21,8 ngh\u00ecn t\u1ea5n g\u1ea1o c\u1ee9u \u0111\u00f3i v\u00e0 c\u00e1c h\u1ed9 ngh\u00e8o, c\u1eadn ngh\u00e8o, ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u00f3 ho\u00e0n c\u1ea3nh kh\u00f3 kh\u0103n.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a href=\"#_ftnref1\" name=\"_ftn1\">[1]<\/a> C\u00e1c n\u0103m 2020-2022 t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ebfn h\u1ebft 20\/11 h\u00e0ng n\u0103m, n\u0103m 2023 v\u00e0 n\u0103m 2024 t\u00ednh \u0111\u1ebfn h\u1ebft 30\/11.<\/p>\n<\/div><div class=\"fusion-clearfix\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-2 fusion-flex-container nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling\" style=\"--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;\" ><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start\" style=\"max-width:1144px;margin-left: calc(-4% \/ 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% \/ 2 );\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-1 fusion_builder_column_1_1 1_1 fusion-flex-column\" style=\"--awb-bg-color:#f2f2f2;--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:100%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:1.92%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:1.92%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-order-medium:0;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-order-small:0;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-column-has-shadow fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\"><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-2\"><hr \/>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"lazyload size-fusion-800 wp-image-41615 alignleft\" src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-800x146.png\" data-orig-src=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-800x146.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"146\" srcset=\"data:image\/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27800%27%20height%3D%27146%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%20800%20146%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%27800%27%20height%3D%27146%27%20fill-opacity%3D%220%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-200x37.png 200w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-300x55.png 300w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-400x73.png 400w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-600x110.png 600w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-768x141.png 768w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-800x146.png 800w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-1024x187.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-1200x220.png 1200w, https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/12\/tin-khac-01-1-1536x281.png 1536w\" data-sizes=\"auto\" data-orig-sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-3 fusion-flex-container nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling\" style=\"--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;\" ><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start\" style=\"max-width:1144px;margin-left: calc(-4% \/ 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% \/ 2 );\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-2 fusion_builder_column_1_6 1_6 fusion-flex-column\" style=\"--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:16.666666666667%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:11.52%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:11.52%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-order-medium:0;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-order-small:0;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-column-has-shadow fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\"><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-3 fusion_builder_column_5_6 5_6 fusion-flex-column\" style=\"--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:83.333333333333%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:2.304%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:2.304%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-order-medium:0;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-order-small:0;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-column-has-shadow fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\"><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-3\"><div class=\"document-type-news\"><\/p>\n<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/tin-tuc-khac\/2026\/10\/nhung-tin-hieu-tich-cuc-cua-thi-truong-lao-dong-trong-9-thang-nam-2026\/\">Nh\u1eefng t\u00edn hi\u1ec7u t\u00edch c\u1ef1c c\u1ee7a th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng lao \u0111\u1ed9ng trong 9 th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2026<\/a><\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p>Th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng lao \u0111\u1ed9ng Vi\u1ec7t Nam trong 9 th\u00e1ng n\u0103m 2026 c\u00f3 nhi\u1ec1u chuy\u1ec3n bi\u1ebfn t\u00edch c\u1ef1c. L\u1ef1c l\u01b0\u1ee3ng lao \u0111\u1ed9ng v\u00e0 s\u1ed1 ng\u01b0\u1eddi c\u00f3 vi\u1ec7c l\u00e0m t\u0103ng, thu nh\u1eadp b\u00ecnh qu\u00e2n th\u00e1ng c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi lao \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ea3i thi\u1ec7n; t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng thi\u1ebfu vi\u1ec7c l\u00e0m, lao \u0111\u1ed9ng phi ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c v\u00e0 lao \u0111\u1ed9ng kh\u00f4ng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng h\u1ebft ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng c\u00f3 xu h\u01b0\u1edbng gi\u1ea3m. \u0110\u00e1ng ch\u00fa \u00fd, c\u01a1 c\u1ea5u lao \u0111\u1ed9ng ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c chuy\u1ec3n d\u1ecbch theo h\u01b0\u1edbng gi\u1ea3m t\u1ef7 tr\u1ecdng lao \u0111\u1ed9ng khu v\u1ef1c n\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p, t\u0103ng t\u1ef7 tr\u1ecdng lao \u0111\u1ed9ng trong khu v\u1ef1c c\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng, khu v\u1ef1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi vi\u1ec7c l\u00e0m trong c\u00e1c ng\u00e0nh kinh t\u1ebf s\u1ed1 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng. <span>(12\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/tin-tuc-khac\/2026\/08\/phat-trien-y-hoc-co-truyen-viet-nam-gan-voi-cham-soc-suc-khoe-nhan-dan-va-phat-trien-dat-nuoc\/\">Ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n y h\u1ecdc c\u1ed5 truy\u1ec1n Vi\u1ec7t Nam g\u1eafn v\u1edbi ch\u0103m s\u00f3c s\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe Nh\u00e2n d\u00e2n v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ea5t n\u01b0\u1edbc<\/a><\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p>Y h\u1ecdc c\u1ed5 truy\u1ec1n kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00f4ng t\u00e1c b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7, ch\u0103m s\u00f3c s\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe Nh\u00e2n d\u00e2n m\u00e0 c\u00f2n g\u1eafn tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp v\u1edbi gi\u1eef g\u00ecn b\u1ea3n s\u1eafc v\u0103n h\u00f3a d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c, ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u00f4ng nghi\u1ec7p d\u01b0\u1ee3c li\u1ec7u, kinh t\u1ebf s\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng cao s\u1ee9c m\u1ea1nh m\u1ec1m qu\u1ed1c gia. V\u00ec v\u1eady, c\u1ea7n b\u1ea3o t\u1ed3n, ph\u00e1t huy v\u00e0 n\u00e2ng t\u1ea7m y h\u1ecdc c\u1ed5 truy\u1ec1n d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c, bi\u1ebfn nh\u1eefng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb, di s\u1ea3n qu\u00fd b\u00e1u c\u1ee7a cha \u00f4ng th\u00e0nh ngu\u1ed3n l\u1ef1c quan tr\u1ecdng ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 ch\u0103m s\u00f3c s\u1ee9c kh\u1ecfe Nh\u00e2n d\u00e2n v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ea5t n\u01b0\u1edbc trong th\u1eddi k\u1ef3 m\u1edbi. <span>(10\/08\/2026)<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/tin-tuc-khac\/2026\/05\/hoan-thien-quy-dinh-ve-pho-bien-thong-tin-thong-ke-quoc-gia\/\">Ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n quy \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u1ec1 ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn th\u00f4ng tin th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea qu\u1ed1c gia<\/a><\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p>Th\u00f4ng tin th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7, ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c, k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi v\u00e0 minh b\u1ea1ch c\u00f3 vai tr\u00f2 quan tr\u1ecdng trong c\u00f4ng t\u00e1c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd, \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u00e0nh v\u00e0 ho\u1ea1ch \u0111\u1ecbnh ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n kinh t\u1ebf - x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i. Vi\u1ec7c Ch\u00ednh ph\u1ee7 ban h\u00e0nh Ngh\u1ecb \u0111\u1ecbnh s\u1ed1 13\/2026\/N\u0110-CP ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n c\u01a1 s\u1edf ph\u00e1p l\u00fd v\u1ec1 ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn th\u00f4ng tin th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea qu\u1ed1c gia, n\u00e2ng cao hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 c\u00f4ng b\u1ed1, cung c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u00f4ng tin th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea trong giai \u0111o\u1ea1n m\u1edbi. <span>(21\/05\/2026)<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/tin-tuc-khac\/2026\/05\/chuan-hoa-che-do-bao-cao-thong-ke-cap-quoc-gia-phuc-vu-cong-tac-quan-ly-va-dieu-hanh\/\">Chu\u1ea9n h\u00f3a ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 b\u00e1o c\u00e1o th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea c\u1ea5p qu\u1ed1c gia ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 c\u00f4ng t\u00e1c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd v\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u00e0nh<\/a><\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p>D\u1eef li\u1ec7u th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7, ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c v\u00e0 k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng quan tr\u1ecdng ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 c\u00f4ng t\u00e1c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd, \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u00e0nh v\u00e0 ho\u1ea1ch \u0111\u1ecbnh ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n kinh t\u1ebf - x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i. Vi\u1ec7c Ch\u00ednh ph\u1ee7 ban h\u00e0nh Ngh\u1ecb \u0111\u1ecbnh s\u1ed1 139\/2026\/N\u0110-CP g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng b\u00e1o c\u00e1o th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea c\u1ea5p qu\u1ed1c gia; n\u00e2ng cao ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng cung c\u1ea5p, t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng th\u00f4ng tin th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea trong giai \u0111o\u1ea1n m\u1edbi. <span>(21\/05\/2026)<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/tin-tuc-khac\/2026\/05\/thong-ke-noi-vung-bien\/\">Th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea n\u01a1i v\u00f9ng bi\u00ean<\/a><\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p>18 n\u0103m l\u00e0m ngh\u1ec1, anh Nguy\u1ec5n V\u0103n To\u00e0n, Tr\u01b0\u1edfng Th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea c\u01a1 s\u1edf N\u00e0 H\u1ef3, t\u1ec9nh \u0110i\u1ec7n Bi\u00ean kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 qu\u00ean nh\u1eefng l\u1ea7n c\u00f9ng \u0103n, c\u00f9ng ng\u1ee7 v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed3ng b\u00e0o d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c L\u00e0o, d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c M\u00f4ng, d\u00e2n t\u1ed9c Th\u00e1i. <span>(06\/05\/2026)<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/www.nso.gov.vn\/tin-tuc-khac\/2026\/05\/nganh-thong-ke-hoi-nhap-tinh-toan-gdp-theo-chuan-quoc-te\/\">Ng\u00e0nh th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea h\u1ed9i nh\u1eadp, t\u00ednh to\u00e1n GDP theo chu\u1ea9n qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf<\/a><\/h3>\n<p><\/p>\n<p>S\u1ef1 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\u1ee7a U\u1ef7 ban Th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea Li\u00ean H\u1ee3p qu\u1ed1c, UNDP, WB, ADB, IFC, ILO nh\u1eefng n\u0103m sau \u0111\u1ed5i m\u1edbi \u0111\u00e3 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y h\u1ed9i nh\u1eadp qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf c\u1ee7a ng\u00e0nh th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea, n\u00e2ng ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1ed1 li\u1ec7u th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea Vi\u1ec7t Nam theo chu\u1ea9n m\u1ef1c qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf. <span>(05\/05\/2026)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><\/p>\n<p class=\"document-type-archive\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><a href=\"\/tin-tuc-khac\">Xem th\u00eam<\/a><\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-4 fusion-flex-container nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling\" style=\"--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;\" ><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start\" style=\"max-width:1144px;margin-left: calc(-4% \/ 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% \/ 2 );\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-4 fusion_builder_column_1_1 1_1 fusion-flex-column\" style=\"--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:100%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:1.92%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:1.92%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-order-medium:0;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-order-small:0;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-column-has-shadow fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\"><div class=\"fusion-widget-area awb-widget-area-element fusion-widget-area-1 fusion-content-widget-area post-taxonomy-metadata\" style=\"--awb-title-color:#333333;--awb-padding:0px 0px 0px 0px;\"><div class=\"fusion-additional-widget-content\"><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/p>\n","protected":false}}